    4. if fill-bottom-row - either (a) build a closed U whose horizontal span does NOT include the marker column, or (b) build only a broken U-like branch with a bottom gap or missing side and no closed U at all; place marker on row 0 outside any closed U footprint; ensure bottom row is all bg
    5. verify exactly one singleton marker pixel on row 0, 0 or 1 closed U containers, and bottom row all bg
